- B>R | rent a cheap room away from the institute, so nobody can drop by | v: self-direction, hedonism | chance: 88
- R>G | have your partner and friends round to celebrate, and talk about the work all night | v: hedonism, benevolence | chance: 92
- G>W | offer to help the local society that has logged the question for decades | door | v: tradition, benevolence | mark: made a friend | chance: 68
