threshold: title:independent investigator
step: 2
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 25-95
times: once, in the first months after becoming an independent investigator, for the many whose first paper or proposal sent alone is turned down; funders refuse most proposals; about 1 life in 2,000 ever works this way (estimate)
