- U | follow the sharper question, and write to the funders to explain the change | identity | v: self-direction, universalism | chance: 66
- B | take the company's money and build a practice that answers to no fellowship | identity | binds | v: power, self-direction | grants: patron | chance: 48
- R | chase the question nobody would fund, and stake your own savings on it | identity | binds | v: self-direction, stimulation | mark: took a wild risk | chance: 48
- G | take up the question the people of the place have always asked | identity | binds | v: benevolence, tradition | grants: community listening | chance: 62
