- U>G | let the work become a patient study of one living system, however long it takes | identity | binds | v: universalism, tradition | chance: 72
- B>W | sell your speciality to public agencies as a service they can rely on | identity | v: power, security | chance: 75
- R>U | throw yourself into the strangest result in the data until it makes sense | identity | v: stimulation | grants: a nose for the odd result | chance: 72
- G>B | tie the question to one place, and become the one who knows it best | identity | v: power, tradition | grants: fieldwork | chance: 72
works: {N} knows whose question it is now, and the work runs faster for knowing.
works: The people the work is for, whoever they turn out to be, start to rely on it.
fails: {N} swings between questions for months and finishes none of them.
